 color: #f3f4f6; line-height: 1px; max-height: 0; max-width: 0; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden;\">A new website enquiry is ready to review.</div>\n\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 20px 10px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" class=\"email-container\" style=\"max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px;  overflow: hidden;\">\n          \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 12px 28px 12px 28px; text-align: left; \">\n            <h1 style=\"margin: 0; color: #243047; font-size: 32px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Arial Nova', 'Nimbus Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.3; \">\n              New submission: Contact &lt;sales&gt;\n            </h1>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 12px 28px 12px 28px; text-align: left; color: #243047; font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Arial Nova', 'Nimbus Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.6; \">\n            Someone has submitted Contact &lt;sales&gt; on Sample &amp; Co.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 12px 28px 12px 28px; \">\n            <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #243047; margin: 0;\" />\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 12px 28px 12px 28px; text-align: left; color: #243047; font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Arial Nova', 'Nimbus Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.6; \">\n            <p><strong>Your name</strong><br>Example answer</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 12px 28px 12px 28px; text-align: left; color: #243047; font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Arial Nova', 'Nimbus Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.6; \">\n            Sample &amp; Co\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 12px 28px 12px 28px; text-align: left; color: #243047; font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Arial Nova', 'Nimbus Sans', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.6; \">\n            <img src=\"data:image/png;base64,aGVsbG8=\" alt=\"Sample image\" width=\"200\" style=\"display:block;width:200px;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;\" />\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>",
